label q3
koko: Soal 3\: Siapa yang menulis "Romeo and Juliet"?
- Charles Dickens
	koko: Dickens menulis Oliver Twist dan A Christmas Carol. Bukan Romeo and Juliet.
	[signal arg="wrong"]
- Shakespeare
	koko: Benar. William Shakespeare, sekitar 1594-1596. Karya tragedi paling terkenal.
	[signal arg="correct"]
- Jane Austen
	koko: Jane Austen menulis Pride and Prejudice. Romeo and Juliet karya Shakespeare.
	[signal arg="wrong"]
